  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Yes, standard homeowners insurance policies in Utah typically cover hail damage to your dwelling, other structures, and personal property."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "What is Covered"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Dwelling Coverage (Coverage A): Repairs or rebuilds the physical structure of your home, including roofs, siding, gutters, skylights, and windows damaged by hail."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Other Structures (Coverage B): Covers detached structures on your property like a garage, shed, or fence."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Personal Property (Coverage C): Helps replace belongings inside your home if hail breaks a window or roof and ruins items."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Important Details to Check in Utah"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Deductibles: Hail claims may be subject to your standard deductible, but some policies in storm-prone or high-elevation areas enforce a separate percentage deductible specifically for wind and hail damage."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Actual Cash Value (ACV) vs. Replacement Cost: Check whether your roof is covered for its depreciated value (ACV) or full replacement cost. Many insurers shift older roofs to ACV, meaning you pay the difference out of pocket for a brand-new roof."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Cosmetic Exclusions: Some policies exclude purely cosmetic damage (like minor dents to metal siding or vents) if the functional integrity of the material is unaffected."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Vehicles: Home insurance does not cover cars damaged by hail; you need comprehensive auto insurance for that. You can also review state guidelines via the Utah Insurance Department .",
            "snippet_links": [
              {
                "text": "Utah Insurance Department",
                "link": "https://insurance.utah.gov/consumers/home-insurance/home-claims-info/"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you want, tell me:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What insurance provider you have"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Whether you know if your policy has a separate percentage deductible for wind/hail"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you figure out what to look for in your specific declaration page."
      }
    ],
